#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:5
msgid "2D"
msgstr "2D"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:7
msgid ""
"**2D** is the object rendered to a picture, by the same code and with the "
"same options as ``pc render``. Where the :doc:`3D tab "
"</digital_thread/lifecycle/design_3d>` draws geometry the window has been "
"sent, this one asks PartCAD for a *file* and shows it -- so what is on "
"screen is exactly what the command would write, and the **Save…** button "
"writes it wherever you choose."
msgstr ""
"**2D** 就是被渲染成一张图片的那个对象，用的是与 ``pc render`` 相同的代码和相同的选项。:doc:`3D 标签页 "
"</digital_thread/lifecycle/design_3d>` 画的是被送到窗口里的几何，而这一个则向 PartCAD 要一个 *文件* "
"并把它显示出来 -- 所以屏幕上的东西正是那条命令会写出来的东西，而 **Save…** 按钮会把它写到你指定的任何地方。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:14
msgid "In the UI"
msgstr "在界面中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:16
msgid ""
"A format is chosen from a list: **PNG**, **JPEG** or **SVG**. The picture is"
" zoomed with the mouse wheel, dragged with the pointer, and put back with a "
"double-click."
msgstr "从一个列表里选择格式：**PNG**、**JPEG** 或 **SVG**。图片可以用鼠标滚轮缩放、用指针拖动，双击即可复位。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:20
msgid ""
"The tab has the same tree down its left as the 3D tab, and it means the same"
" thing: what is ticked is what is drawn, and a port ticked here is a port "
"drawn on the picture -- what ``pc render --with-ports`` and ``--with-"
"internals`` produce. The :ref:`view panel <dt-design-3d>` applies as well: "
"the axis buttons are the views ``pc render --view`` names, so the picture "
"after clicking **-Y** is the picture ``--view front`` draws, and a section "
"set on the 3D tab is drawn cut here too, because PartCAD cuts the solid "
"rather than the image."
msgstr ""
"这个标签页左侧有和 3D 标签页一样的那棵树，而它的含义也相同：勾上的就是画出来的，而在这里勾上的端口就是画在图片上的端口 -- 也就是 ``pc "
"render --with-ports`` 和 ``--with-internals`` 所产出的东西。:ref:`视图面板 <dt-"
"design-3d>` 同样适用：那些轴按钮就是 ``pc render --view`` 所指名的那些视图，所以点过 **-Y** 之后的那张图就是 "
"``--view front`` 所画出的图；而在 3D 标签页上设定的剖切，在这里画出来也是剖开的，因为 PartCAD 剖切的是实体，而不是图像。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:28
msgid ""
"The Design group's 2D tab: the object rendered to a picture, with the format"
" chooser and Save"
msgstr "Design 组的 2D 标签页：被渲染成图片的那个对象，以及格式选择器和 Save"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:33
msgid "It is for a part, an assembly, a scene or a sketch."
msgstr "它适用于零件、装配体、场景或草图。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:36
msgid "On the command line"
msgstr "在命令行中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:45
msgid ""
":doc:`/config_output` describes every :ref:`file type <output-files>` and "
"the options each takes, including how a package's own ``render:`` section "
"states them once for every object in it rather than on each command."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/config_output` 描述了每一种 :ref:`文件类型 <output-files>` "
"以及它们各自所接受的选项，包括某个包自己的 ``render:`` 小节如何为它里面的每一个对象把它们写明一次，而不必在每条命令上都写。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:50
msgid "Agent skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:52
msgid "``/pc:render``"
msgstr "``/pc:render``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:53
msgid ""
"Produces the pictures -- several views of one object, since a single "
"projection hides whatever is behind it. It is how every generating skill "
"checks what it wrote, and how ``/pc:validate`` gathers the evidence for a "
"requirement nothing can measure."
msgstr ""
"产出那些图片 -- 同一个对象的若干个视图，因为单独一张投影会把它背后的东西全都藏起来。每一项生成类技能正是靠它来检查自己写出的东西，而 "
"``/pc:validate`` 也正是靠它为一项没有任何东西能测量的需求收集依据。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:58
msgid "``/pc:describe``"
msgstr "``/pc:describe``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_2d.rst:59
msgid ""
"Writes an object's ``summary:`` from its measured size and these renders."
msgstr "根据对象的实测尺寸和这些渲染图写出它的 ``summary:`` 。"
